{"book":"ezra","model":"glm-4.5","timestamp":"2026-05-04T03:08:08.852409391Z","verse":12,"ref":"ezra 9:12","tier":"bulk","chapter":9,"translation":"And now do not give your daughters to their sons, and do not take their daughters for your sons, and do not seek ⟨is⟩ their peace or their good forever, so that you may be strong and eat ⟨את⟩ the good ⟨of⟩ ⟨the⟩ land, and possess ⟨it⟩ for your sons forever.","tokens":[{"surface":"ועתה","gloss":"And now"},{"surface":"בנותיכם","gloss":"your daughters"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"do not"},{"surface":"תתנו","gloss":"give"},{"surface":"לבניהם","gloss":"to their sons"},{"surface":"ובנתיהם","gloss":"and their daughters"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"do not"},{"surface":"תשאו","gloss":"take"},{"surface":"לבניכם","gloss":"for your sons"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and do not"},{"surface":"תדרשו","gloss":"seek"},{"surface":"שלמם","gloss":"their peace"},{"surface":"וטובתם","gloss":"or their good"},{"surface":"עד","gloss":"forever"},{"surface":"עולם","gloss":"forever"},{"surface":"למען","gloss":"so that"},{"surface":"תחזקו","gloss":"you may be strong"},{"surface":"ואכלתם","gloss":"and eat"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the good of the land"},{"surface":"טוב","gloss":"the good"},{"surface":"הארץ","gloss":"⟨of⟩ ⟨the⟩ land"},{"surface":"והורשתם","gloss":"and possess ⟨it⟩"},{"surface":"לבניכם","gloss":"for your sons"},{"surface":"עד","gloss":"forever"},{"surface":"עולם","gloss":"forever"}]}